HB0006 Advance health care directives-dementia.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Larsen, L and Senator(s) Barlow
AN ACT relating to the Wyoming health care decisions act; amending the
definition of advance health care directive to include dementia directives; and
providing for an effective date.
